The smallest possible example: add 3 and 5 then print 8

+++                 cell 0 starts at 3
>+++++              cell 1 starts at 5
<[- >+ <]           add cell 0 into cell 1 (cell 0 drains to zero)
>                   go to the result (8)
++++++++++++++++++++++++++++++++++++++++++++++++.   add 48 to print it as ASCII
